@startuml 12-部署图
title 部署视图（本地开发形态）
skinparam shadowing false

node "开发机 / 演示机" {

  node "Docker Engine" {
    node "metro-mysql\nmysql:8" as MYSQL {
      artifact "库 metro\n表 metric_window" as T1
    }
    node "metro-redis\nredis:7" as REDIS {
      artifact "stream gate_events" as T2
      artifact "key metric:snapshot" as T3
    }
  }

  node "Python 进程组" {
    node "模拟器\nsimulator.py" as SIM
    node "消费者\nconsumer.py" as CON
    node "Web 服务\nmanage.py runserver :8000" as WEB
  }

  node "浏览器" as BROWSER
}

MYSQL -[hidden]- REDIS
SIM --> REDIS : 6379 写事件
REDIS --> CON : 6379 读事件
CON --> REDIS : 写快照
CON --> MYSQL : 3306 写明细
WEB --> REDIS : 读快照
WEB --> MYSQL : 读历史
BROWSER --> WEB : HTTP :8000

note right of WEB
  页面由 Django 渲染，
  与接口同源，无需 CORS。
  生产部署可换成
  gunicorn + nginx。
end note
@enduml
